    "title": "Geometric and mechanical properties dataset of marram grass (calamagrostis arenaria, formerly ammophila arenaria) across dune habitats on spiekeroog island (december 2021 - december 2022): exploring seasonal and site-specific variability in marram grass' geometric and mechanical traits through field investigations and bending tests",
